# Lab 11 – Programming Fundamentals

## 📌 Introduction
This lab focuses on applying core programming concepts in C such as recursion and structures. 
The tasks help in understanding problem-solving techniques used in real-world applications like system design, security checks, and data management.

---
## 🎯 Objectives
- To implement recursive functions for problem solving
- To understand and use structures and nested structures in C
- To handle arrays of structures for storing multiple records
- To perform searching and filtering operations on data
- To improve logical thinking and programming skills in C

---
## 🧪 Tasks Covered
- Recursive power calculation for building floors
- Password strength checker using recursion
- Recursive maze path counting
- Patient record system using structures
- University course catalog using nested structures
- E-commerce order tracker system

---
## 🧠 Outcome
After completing this lab, students can design and implement structured and recursive solutions for moderate-level programming problems.
